<p>Perhaps the most valuable gift you can give a sim racer is not stuff. It's showing some interest and respect for their hobby. Create a custom voucher where THEY become your instructor and teach you the ropes on track. Let them guide you through a few laps, explain their setup, and share what makes sim racing so captivating to them.</p>
